      "content": "but it's not just about \"roles\" or \"external markers\". it's that when you strip all the intellect and the purpose away, there's literally no reason to keep going. everything i was supposed to be is gone. it feels like the only thing left is just... the struggle. and i'm so tired of struggling for nothing.",
